{
 "total": 30.033,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 3.764,
   "texto": "A character from Vice City shows up in GTA 6, and he shouldn't look like that.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 3.824,
   "b": 6.252,
   "texto": "Part four of five. Follow, only one left.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 6.312,
   "b": 10.191,
   "texto": "Fans spotted Phil Cassidy on a TV in the second trailer, with both arms.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 10.251,
   "b": 13.176,
   "texto": "In Vice City, Phil lost an arm. So how is he whole again?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 13.236,
   "b": 14.454,
   "texto": "Theory one: it's his son.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 14.514,
   "b": 18.241,
   "texto": "Theory two: the old games were just movies inside GTA 6's world.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 18.301,
   "b": 21.724,
   "texto": "And some fans say the tech in the trailer means it can't be the same old Vice City.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 21.784,
   "b": 24.971,
   "texto": "But if the old Vice City was just a movie, what's real in Leonida?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 25.031,
   "b": 27.331,
   "texto": "Because the map might be way bigger than one city.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 27.391,
   "b": 30.033,
   "texto": "Son or movie? Comment now. The final part is next.",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
